# Internal logs folder (source-of-truth for the Acknowledged Logs page).
# The secret-shortcut.js is un-ignored so the Alt+Shift+W+S handler ships
# with the public site, while the .md source stays in the team-only folder.
# Note: must use `*` not `/` here — a directory-level ignore prevents
# the `!` re-include rule from working (per Git docs).
internal-logs/*
!internal-logs/secret-shortcut.js
